#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:69
#: bfb5185250164ed0bb9961e61a4b6ed3
msgid "The engine is also automatically stopped or started in some situations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:71
#: 3520219a4c1642a2a76ccbaf9cd1785a
msgid "In auto missions, the engine can be started and stopped using the :ref:`DO_ENGINE_CONTROL<mav_cmd_do_engine_control>` mission command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:72
#: 15c1bbccbed14a5790b652e48c5ec758
msgid "On quadplanes, the engine will be automatically disabled during the final stage of a VTOL landing if :ref:`Q_LAND_ICE_CUT<Q_LAND_ICE_CUT>` is set to 1. This is useful to reduce dust ingestion and the risk of prop strikes while landing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:73
#: fc8f7e56245d42a2aea32db9c6bf793e
msgid "If :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 0 is set (value +1), the engine will automatically disable during RC failsafe."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:74
#: 7ef6afb2bfcd44a5be8af19946a0faee
msgid "The engine will automatically disable during an emergency stop AUX function, if configured. See :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:75
#: a122ef9002314031ab61aab3b92afa10
msgid "The engine will automatically disable during parachute deployment, if used. See :ref:`common-parachute`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:77
#: db4de56f690c4a6d9495fc79454e02d0
msgid "By default, the engine cannot be started while disarmed. If you want to allow it to start while disarmed, either set :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>` to a value greater than zero, or set :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 2 (value +4) to allow throttle control while disarmed in Manual mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:79
#: 6a06464eb6854a058b7e04e8c16f9869
msgid "If you would like to use :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>`, but *don't* want to allow starting while disarmed, set :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 3 (value +8)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:82
#: 081a692fc00342a99ad3c390f9235243
msgid "Even with :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 3 set, the engine can still be started while disarmed with a :ref:`DO_ENGINE_CONTROL<mav_cmd_do_engine_control>` command if param4 is set to 1, though in this case it will only start once and won't attempt to restart if it stalls while still disarmed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:85
#: 6bcaf924f274448c943bb7c0ae8e9731
msgid "Ignition and Starter Outputs"
